= Wave 12 context capture =

'''State: Phase 1 — Context capture.'''

Wave 12 creates a biology/bioinformatics bridge from genetics and genome-scale biology through sequence data, computational analysis, evolutionary inference, systems biology, and reproducible computational practice.

